      "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">요즘 안티그래비티 - 실전 프로젝트 모음</h1><a id=\"user-content-요즘-안티그래비티---실전-프로젝트-모음\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 요즘 안티그래비티 - 실전 프로젝트 모음\" href=\"#요즘-안티그래비티---실전-프로젝트-모음\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">이 레포지토리는 <strong>\"요즘 안티그래비티\"</strong> 과정에서 다루는 실전 프로젝트들의 소스 코드를 담고 있습니다.<br>\n각 프로젝트는 최신 웹 기술 스택(Next.js, Supabase, TypeScript 등)을 기반으로 하며, 단계별로 핵심 아키텍처와 개발 방법론을 학습할 수 있도록 구성되어 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">📂 프로젝트 목록</h2><a id=\"user-content--프로젝트-목록\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📂 프로젝트 목록\" href=\"#-프로젝트-목록\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">각 디렉토리에는 해당 프로젝트의 전체 소스 코드와 설정 파일이 포함되어 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">기초 및 방법론 (Fundamentals)</h3><a id=\"user-content-기초-및-방법론-fundamentals\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 기초 및 방법론 (Fundamentals)\" href=\"#기초-및-방법론-fundamentals\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">프로젝트</th>\n<th align=\"left\">경로</th>\n<th align=\"left\">설명</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Project 4: TDD</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/codefactory-co/golden-rabbit-antigravity-v1/blob/main/4/tdd\"><code>4/tdd</code></a></td>\n<td align=\"left\">테스트 주도 개발(Test Driven Development)을 통한 견고한 코드 작성법 학습</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Project 5: Clean Architecture</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/codefactory-co/golden-rabbit-antigravity-v1/blob/main/5/clean%20architecture\"><code>5/clean architecture</code></a></td>\n<td align=\"left\">유지보수성과 확장성을 극대화하는 클린 아키텍처 설계 패턴 실습</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">실전 애플리케이션 (Applications)</h3><a id=\"user-content-실전-애플리케이션-applications\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 실전 애플리케이션 (Applications)\" href=\"#실전-애플리케이션-applications\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">프로젝트</th>\n<th align=\"left\">경로</th>\n<th align=\"left\">설명</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Project 7: SaaS Landing Page</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/codefactory-co/golden-rabbit-antigravity-v1/blob/main/7/saas-landing-page\"><code>7/saas-landing-page</code></a></td>\n<td align=\"left\">마케팅과 전환율 최적화를 고려한 모던한 SaaS 제품 소개 페이지</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Project 8: Blog</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/codefactory-co/golden-rabbit-antigravity-v1/blob/main/8/blog\"><code>8/blog</code></a></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Next.js의 렌더링 전략과 SEO 최적화를 적용한 블로그 플랫폼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Project 9: Realtime Chat</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/codefactory-co/golden-rabbit-antigravity-v1/blob/main/9/chat\"><code>9/chat</code></a></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Supabase Realtime을 활용한 실시간 채팅 및 메시징 시스템</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Project 10: E-commerce</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/codefactory-co/golden-rabbit-antigravity-v1/blob/main/10/ecommerce\"><code>10/ecommerce</code></a></td>\n<td align=\"left\">상품 관리, 장바구니, 결제 시스템을 갖춘 종합 온라인 쇼핑몰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Project 11: CloudNote SaaS</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/codefactory-co/golden-rabbit-antigravity-v1/blob/main/11/saas\"><code>11/saas</code></a></td>\n<td align=\"left\">AI 요약, 스마트 검색, 구독 결제 기능을 포함한 본격적인 SaaS 메모 서비스</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🚀 시작하기 (Getting Started)</h2><a id=\"user-content--시작하기-getting-started\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🚀 시작하기 (Getting Started)\" href=\"#-시작하기-getting-started\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">각 프로젝트 폴더로 이동하여 의존성을 설치하고 개발 서버를 실행하세요.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# 예시: Project 11 실행\ncd 11/saas\nnpm install\nnpm run dev\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> 예시: Project 11 실행</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">cd</span> 11/saas\nnpm install\nnpm run dev</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🛠 주요 기술 스택</h2><a id=\"user-content--주요-기술-스택\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🛠 주요 기술 스택\" href=\"#-주요-기술-스택\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Framework</strong>: Next.js (App Router)</li>\n<li><strong>Language</strong>: TypeScript</li>\n<li><strong>Styling</strong>: Tailwind CSS</li>\n<li><strong>Backend/DB</strong>: Supabase</li>\n<li><strong>Deployment</strong>: Vercel</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>참고</strong>: 각 프로젝트 폴더 내의 <code>README.md</code> 파일에서 더 상세한 실행 방법과 프로젝트 설명을 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</article>",
